@startuml L4_Code_ReservationCore
title NekoCafé C4 L4 - Reservation Core Code View
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class ReservationApplicationService {
  +createReservation(cmd)
  +rescheduleReservation(cmd)
  +cancelReservation(cmd)
}
class ReservationPolicy {
  +validateBusinessHours(store, slot)
  +validatePartySize(tableSlot, partySize)
  +canCancel(reservation, now)
}
class CapacityLockManager {
  +tryLock(tableId, timeSlot, ttl)
  +release(lockId)
}
class Reservation {
  +id
  +memberId
  +storeId
  +tableId
  +timeSlot
  +status
  +confirm()
  +cancel()
}
class Waitlist {
  +rank
  +promote()
}
interface ReservationRepository {
  +save(reservation)
  +findById(id)
}
class OutboxEvent {
  +eventId
  +aggregateId
  +type
  +payload
}
ReservationApplicationService --> ReservationPolicy
ReservationApplicationService --> CapacityLockManager
ReservationApplicationService --> ReservationRepository
ReservationApplicationService --> OutboxEvent
ReservationApplicationService --> Waitlist
ReservationPolicy --> Reservation
ReservationRepository --> Reservation
OutboxEvent ..> Reservation : ReservationConfirmed/Cancelled
note right of ReservationApplicationService
事务边界：
1. 校验会员/门店/猫咪状态
2. 获取容量锁
3. 保存预约和 Outbox
4. 提交后异步发布事件
end note
@enduml
